# 这是一个最小可运行的示例剧本。
# 所有缩进只为可读性，解析器会忽略行首空白。

title "放课后的约定"

label start
bg classroom
show alice normal center
say "艾莉丝" "啊，你还没走？太好了。"
narrate "夕阳把教室染成暖橙色，艾莉丝从窗边转过身来。"
say "艾莉丝" "今天社团结束得早，要不要一起回去？"
menu
option "陪她去图书馆" library
option "去天台吹风" rooftop
option "今天想直接回家" home
endmenu

label library
bg library
show alice smile center
flag went_library 1
say "艾莉丝" "你居然愿意陪我来，好开心。"
narrate "两人在书架间找那本她念叨了很久的小说。"
say "夏树" "喂，你们也来图书馆？真巧。"
show natsuki normal right
add affection 1
jump evening

label rooftop
bg rooftop
show alice blush center
flag went_rooftop 1
say "艾莉丝" "这里的晚风，好舒服……"
narrate "她的发梢被风轻轻吹起。"
add affection 1
jump evening

label home
bg street
show alice normal center
flag went_home 1
say "艾莉丝" "那……明天见。"
narrate "你们在路口分开，夕阳把影子拉得很长。"
jump evening

label evening
bg sunset
show alice smile center
if went_library -> library_ending
if went_rooftop -> rooftop_ending
if went_home -> home_ending
jump library_ending

label library_ending
bg sunset
show alice blush center
say "艾莉丝" "找到那本书的时候，你好像比我还开心。"
narrate "后来，那本小说成了你们共同的秘密。"
sfx click
end

label rooftop_ending
bg sunset
show alice smile center
say "艾莉丝" "下次……还可以一起上来吗？"
narrate "你没有回答，只是点了点头。"
end

label home_ending
bg sunset
show alice normal center
say "艾莉丝" "虽然今天很普通，但能一起走一段路，已经很好。"
narrate "也许明天，故事还会继续。"
end
